      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-2889",
      ":question/problem": "A group of students was recording a video for a school project. While recording, a student noticed that Tommy's shadow was shrinking as he approached the nearby $4.5m$ light post. They were able to measure that Tommy's shadow was changing at a rate of $2m/s$. If Tommy is $1.5m$ tall, how fast is he walking towards the light post?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
